{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"半单Lie代数"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“半单 Lie 代数”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $\\mathfrak g$ 为有限维 Lie 代数. 若 $\\mathfrak g$ 没有非零的"},{"Local":{"url":"可解","text":"可解 Lie 代数"}},{"Plain":"理想, 即 $\\operatorname{rad}\\mathfrak g = 0$ ($\\operatorname{rad}\\mathfrak g$ 是 $\\mathfrak g$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"根","text":"根 (Lie 代数)"}},{"Plain":"), 则称之为<strong>半单 Lie 代数</strong>.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>半单 Lie 代数是"},{"Local":{"url":"单Lie代数","text":"单 Lie 代数"}},{"Plain":"的直和.</p>\n"}]}}